(b) Chancellor;
(c) Vice-Chancellor;

(d) Deans;
(e) Principals of the constituent colleges;
(f) Head of the teaching departments;
(g) Registrar;
(h) Treasurer;
(i) Controller of Examinations; and
(j) such other persons as may be prescribed by the statutes or regulations.

